    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME TO ViTURE, Inc.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the <strong>ViTURE</strong>! Largest entertainment company in whole Pandei, which created famous characters like Gehemon, Carnie the Cat and The Angel of Salvation:\u00a0Samigina. Find out the true reason of company closing and all it's darkest secrets...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SYNOPSIS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the <strong>ViTURE</strong> Park! Underground unbelivable sizes park filled with magic and <span class=\"bb_strike\">death</span> <strong>fun</strong>! Huge underground park, warehouse, labarotary, city. But be aware of everything... Filled with deadly experiments and machinery complex. Discover every inch of complex. Mutants, Robots, Slaved People.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >W\u0334\u035d\u0313\u0346E\u0334\u034b\u031a\u0322 \u0334\u0341\u0355E\u0335\u0360\u0313\u0330X\u0335\u0344\u0320P\u0338\u0343\u0346\u0318E\u0334\u034c\u0343\u031dC\u0337\u035b\u030e\u033cT\u0336\u0344\u030d\u0323 \u0336\u0360\u0360\u034eY\u0335\u034c\u0346\u032aO\u0337\u0358\u031b\u033bU\u0334\u034c\u031b\u0331 \u0335\u0350\u034a\u0354T\u0335\u0315\u035d\u0324O\u0337\u0340\u0310\u0329 \u0335\u034b\u030f\u035cD\u0337\u0344\u033f\u0329I\u0335\u034c\u035d\u031fE\u0334\u033f\u0360\u033a \u0334\u0341\u0307\u032cT\u0336\u0340\u0358\u0333H\u0334\u030b\u030d\u031fE\u0334\u033f\u0350\u0329R\u0335\u0344\u033f\u0349E\u0338\u034c\u033f\u033a</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Chromium and Blood Moons powers to fight your enemies, destroy all obstacles on your way, solve puzzles, etc. Eye-pleasing locations filled with secrets, be on guard and look for it! Try to avoid enemies by exploiting their weaknesses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore. Survive. Reveal. Fight. Die.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique OST</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interesting story</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eye-pleasing locations</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use Chromium in battles, exploring levels, solving puzzles and much more!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create objects from Chromium</strong></p></li></ul>",
